1\\\\\\\\. Degree, preferably major in Business Administration or Finance;

2\\\\\\\\. At least 1 year of related work experiences;

3\\\\\\\\. Ability to use Word, Excel, and Powerpoint together with strong analytical and communication skills;

4\\\\\\\\. Good analytical, quantitative and communication skills.



