About FWD Group
FWD Group (1828\\\\\\\\.HK) is a pan\\\\\\\\-Asian life and health insurance business that serves approximately 34 million customers across 10 markets, including BRI Life in Indonesia. FWD’s customer\\\\\\\\-led and tech\\\\\\\\-enabled approach aims to deliver innovative propositions, easy\\\\\\\\-to\\\\\\\\-understand products and a simpler insurance experience. Established in 2013, the company operates in some of the fastest\\\\\\\\-growing insurance markets in the world with a vision of changing the way people feel about insurance. FWD Group is listed on the main board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange under the stock code 1828\\\\\\\\.
For more information, please visit www.fwd.com
For more information about FWD Hong Kong, please visit www.fwd.com.hk/.
The Job* Be the key person in overviewing and arranging daily policy delivery to business partners;
* Handle wide range of after sales servicing requests (e.g. policy delivery, change of policy ownership/insured/beneficiary, policy feature application, policy surrender and claim, collateral assignments etc.) to distribution channels to ensure service standards are met;
