* Take part in maintenance of the broker portal;
* Assist in onboarding banks for premium financing facility;
* Prepare training materials and participate in training for business partners when required;
* Assist ad\\\\\\\\-hoc projects if need.


The Person* Bachelor’s degree holder or above with experience in policy administration and general insurance policy servicing, preferred in life insurance business with operations knowledge;
* 3–5 years of relevant experience in life insurance operations or business support;
* Detail\\\\\\\\-minded, organized and with good interpersonal skills in communication with our internal departments and business partners;
* Positive and driven work attitude and ability to work independently and as part of a team;
